+          "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE original production reward background for Reveal Line, a pixel-art FPV territory-capture game. Genuine deliberately chunky 16-bit pixel art: square clusters, crisp stepped edges, flat color ramps, recognizable silhouettes, modest detail, approximately 384-pixel logical horizontal resolution displayed large. Restrained field-kit palette: deep ink/navy #070b12, charcoal #101923, slate blue #425563, muted teal/green #687c55, off-white #f3f0db, warm amber #f4bf62 used sparingly; extend with a few controlled earth and sky ramps. Beautiful atmospheric composition that rewards revealing it, but no bloom, blur, texture noise, smooth painting, gradients, tiny speckles or photorealism. Quiet midground separates live gameplay from scenery. No text, logos, HUD, borders, icons, people, flying drones, propellers, active actors, capture lines, military insignia, weapons or UI. Art fills the full opaque rectangular canvas. One scene only, no panels or montage. This is a new original composition from the written brief, not a copy of another game. Keep important landmarks and open spaces legible as a small 240px gallery thumbnail.\nScene: Orchard gate at sunset. Wide 2:1 composition. A modest weathered blue farm gate sits open in the left foreground under blocky pale blossom branches. An open earthen path leads through ordered orchard trees toward low village roofs and a distant field at amber dusk. Keep sky and path broad and calm. The recognizable gate, blossom frame and village form three deliberate depth layers. Radio work is suggested only by a small inactive aerial on a distant shed. Target output 1536×768, intended separately prepared 1152×576.\n\nPREPARED PRODUCTION CONTRACT: 1152×576 opaque PNG. Preserve these exact derivative settings for compatible variations:\n{\n  \"algorithm\": \"field-kit-reveal-pixel-preparation-v1\",\n  \"sourceCrop\": {\n    \"x\": 0,\n    \"y\": 0,\n    \"width\": 1774,\n    \"height\": 887\n  },\n  \"sampling\": \"nearest pixel-center\",\n  \"logicalWidth\": 384,\n  \"logicalHeight\": 192,\n  \"integerScale\": 3,\n  \"clippedEdgePixels\": {\n    \"right\": 0,\n    \"bottom\": 0\n  },\n  \"quantization\": \"fixed36-color weighted RGB nearest; no dithering\",\n  \"palette\": [\n    \"#070b12\",\n    \"#101923\",\n    \"#172837\",\n    \"#213647\",\n    \"#2b4558\",\n    \"#3b586f\",\n    \"#506a82\",\n    \"#718397\",\n    \"#a5b2bb\",\n    \"#c5c8c0\",\n    \"#f3f0db\",\n    \"#163e47\",\n    \"#245966\",\n    \"#326a70\",\n    \"#457f80\",\n    \"#78dce8\",\n    \"#1c302d\",\n    \"#2b4036\",\n    \"#3c5140\",\n    \"#506348\",\n    \"#687c55\",\n    \"#819361\",\n    \"#9dbb7a\",\n    \"#b7c38a\",\n    \"#433d33\",\n    \"#62523e\",\n    \"#806445\",\n    \"#a27d4e\",\n    \"#c29b68\",\n    \"#d7b885\",\n    \"#f4bf62\",\n    \"#dc923f\",\n    \"#bb693a\",\n    \"#8e5740\",\n    \"#464d51\",\n    \"#647786\"\n  ],\n  \"usedColors\": [\n    \"#070b12\",\n    \"#101923\",\n    \"#172837\",\n    \"#213647\",\n    \"#2b4558\",\n    \"#3b586f\",\n    \"#506a82\",\n    \"#718397\",\n    \"#a5b2bb\",\n    \"#c5c8c0\",\n    \"#f3f0db\",\n    \"#245966\",\n    \"#1c302d\",\n    \"#2b4036\",\n    \"#3c5140\",\n    \"#506348\",\n    \"#687c55\",\n    \"#819361\",\n    \"#9dbb7a\",\n    \"#b7c38a\",\n    \"#433d33\",\n    \"#62523e\",\n    \"#806445\",\n    \"#a27d4e\",\n    \"#c29b68\",\n    \"#d7b885\",\n    \"#f4bf62\",\n    \"#dc923f\",\n    \"#bb693a\",\n    \"#8e5740\",\n    \"#464d51\",\n    \"#647786\"\n  ],\n  \"alpha\": \"opaque\",\n  \"disclosure\": \"Generated original sampled to a bounded logical grid, palette-mapped and enlarged with integer clusters. This derivative is not a hand-authored native pixel drawing.\",\n  \"cropDecision\": null\n}",
